    "version": "1.0.0",
    "title": "Weekly Operations Review",
    "description": "Run a weekly operations review with a record per week, its key metrics, the issues raised and the actions agreed, plus automations that open a metrics-collection action for each new week, mark issues still open a week later as carried over and ask for an owner on critical issues.",
